<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-HAMBURG WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-HAMBURG WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBURG, Germany 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results in the $450,000 Hamburg women's tennis tournament on Thursday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Maria Sanchez Lorenzo (Spain) beat Jana Kandarr (Germany) 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>Barbara Schett (Austria) beat 3-Anke Huber (Germany) 6-4 7-6 (7-2)  </p>
<p>Anne-Gaelle Sidot (France) beat Olga Lugina (Ukraine) 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>6-Mary Pierce (France) beat Paola Suarez (Argentinia) 3-6 7-6 (7-3) 6-3</p>
<p>7-Ruxandra Dragomir (Rumania) beat Florencia Labat (Argentina) 7-5 6-3</p>
<p>4-Iva Majoli (Croatia) beat Magul Serna (Spain) 6-4 7-5</p>
</text>
